openSUSE Halloween
==================

An autumn Halloween night theme for openSUSE, generated by
https://github.com/plusky/halloween-openSUSE from its palette.

gtk-3.0/          adw-gtk3-dark 6.5 by lassekongo83
                  (https://github.com/lassekongo83/adw-gtk3, LGPL-2.1),
                  recoloured; the recolouring is LGPL-2.1-or-later
gnome-shell/      GNOME Shell stylesheet, for the User Themes extension
xfwm4/            xfwm4's default window-manager theme by Olivier Fourdan
                  (GPL-2.0-or-later), recoloured
xfce-notify-4.0/  Xfce notification theme
